{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE4L1RoZSUyMEZhbW91cyUyMEZpdmUlMjBBbmQlMjBUaGUlMjBWYWxsZXklMjBPZiUyMERpbm9zYXVycyUyMCUyODIwMTglMjkv","type":"movie","name":"The Famous Five And The Valley Of Dinosaurs","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/cs3wdR4z1H4LIewteZgWG6aPCKU.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rBFY1C8Q0Cx542nxYVsYnc8AmB1.jpg","description":"En route to a party they are not keen on attending, the Famous Five are almost relieved when Aunt Fanny's car breaks down, stranding them in a small town. To pass the time, they visit the local natural history museum, where some newly-discovered dinosaur bones are being unveiled. Here they meet Marty, who tells them that his father, long dead, supposedly found a complete dinosaur skeleton and made a map of its whereabouts. Unfortunately the map has been stolen. Unable to let a good mystery go unsolved, George, Julian, Dick, Anne and Timmy, join a guided hike through the Valley of Dinosaurs. But their fact-finding mission soon turns into a race to find the dinosaur when they suspect that the thief is one of the group.\n\nReleased 15 Mar 2018 · Germany · Language: German · 102 min\nStudio: Constantin Film, SamFilm\n\nOn your server — Audio: German","releaseInfo":"2018","genres":["Family","Adventure","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.9","runtime":"102 min","cast":["Allegra Tinnefeld","Marinus Hohmann","Ron Antony Renzenbrink","Amelie Lammers","Jacob Matschenz","Peter Prager","Melika Foroutan","Dirk Borchardt"],"director":["Mike Marzuk"],"released":"2018-03-15T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Mike Marzuk","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/oHCnhrKe09fUJ7p08lrQDjSr4rX.jpg"},{"name":"Allegra Tinnefeld","character":"George","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/oEPdkZt2ddWVr1gEdcoVipFoKxu.jpg"},{"name":"Marinus Hohmann","character":"Julian","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/j66QbZBX9GoGoz8iF2kjrSjG8wx.jpg"},{"name